{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number, then the simultaneous system \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/d/41d5272d0ab2b1ef3fbc54bbc9fd11160bac85e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nx+y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cadb6e63f2145adf5d211d28a545656561b45d50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ny+z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/3327040a2d8abb7578e4104655d45608256f3da1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+nz = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>has no solution if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/9/f292e0ff7abafb76df9dbe8fd5ab17748a17e63b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0\\text{ or }1\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"409\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Add up all three equations to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2e89b3c01b81626f3241770a3219a3e57b970f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(n+1)(x+y+z) = 3\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/56584f0779cf04f3f0d66161f78cb2175bd832c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, then equation results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/a/d9a440feece765641b5cb11cf5fb0f7174166c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 3$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />.  That has no solutions, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>From the first equation,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5ac8055acfa594f905a6df85ef9374d46cb0d2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = 1 - nx\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\nSubstitute that in the second equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a96d4b4f33b4a71bcc3bfc5180da048bd6ce4dd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n(1-nx) + z = 1\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4a00116662f5d8d64aeccaa1dc8911b9ba6a182.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z = 1 - n + n^2 x\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />\nSubstitute that in the third equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebfef96137d82b2bc386e9af8893c8ecbd9f1b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + n(1-n+n^2 x) = 1\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889e1fd61b085638ec5001210756e0105f0c8806.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+n^3)x + n - n^2 = 1\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"19\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/56584f0779cf04f3f0d66161f78cb2175bd832c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, then equation results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acdc74976077a7334412594ef185f1b582f44d06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />.  That has no solutions, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Probl